# Workflow Router

## Cold-Start

Use `knowledge/INDEX.md` as the single documentation entry point. Conflict order:
`knowledge/memory/OPERATOR_DECISIONS.md` > repo rules > this file.

## Runtime Default

Local Docker only (`:8766` gmail-agent Node B, `:8090` Daszek, `:8091` kalk-top, `:8000` RAG, `:54129` mailbox PG). Production is suspended; do not use VPS/SSH/prod deploy unless the operator explicitly resumes production work.

Harness: `.cursor/rules/35-local-stack-harness-workflow.mdc`.

## Browser

Firefox first for URL opening and UI automation. See `knowledge/memory/OPERATOR_DECISIONS.md`.

## Memory

- Start: `powershell -File scripts/run-session-start-hooks.ps1` then read `C:\top-code-session-scratch\SESSION_START_CONTEXT.md` unless `TOP_CODE_SESSION_SCRATCH` overrides it.
- Stop: update canonical memory only, then run `powershell -File scripts/run-session-stop-hooks.ps1`.
- Persistent memory: only `knowledge/memory/{OPERATOR_DECISIONS,BACKLOG,ACTIVE_WORKSPACE,LAST_SESSION}.md`.
- Scratch outputs: `C:\top-code-session-scratch\` or `TOP_CODE_SESSION_SCRATCH`.

See `.cursor/rules/16-session-memory-protocol.mdc`.

## On Demand

- Tooling / MCP / plugins / graph generation: `knowledge/TOOLING_POLICY.md`.
- Documentation maintenance: `knowledge/DOCUMENTATION_POLICY.md`.
- Do not load generated corpora, full graph outputs, mirrored repos or raw transcripts into context by default.
